title: Customise HyperGSD
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

There are many options for customising ~HyperGSD to your needs and proclivities:

* Out of the box through <$link to="$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/control-panel">Control Panel →&nbsp;Settings →&nbsp;~HyperGSD</$link>
* Through a selection of [[official sub-plugins and by integrating with other plugins in the TW ecosystem|Other plugins]]

If you want to go further, ~HyperGSD is a highly-extensible platform to help you track what you need to do.
See more options on the [[HyperGSD API]] documentation.